# THE BREEDS' LIST (tools/breeds-bake.py): every dog and cat breed: its real size (m: its height or length, whichever is more, capped at pet size), its body
# (archetypes and their own changes; see reshape), its coat pattern (see pattern), its colour varieties (the first is its own), Polyfork's knobs (pf).
# Dog zones: coat (the cape), white, tan, inner, dark (nose, eyes, pads), tongue, mark (spots, merle, brindle, mask), mark2. Cat zones: coat, belly, inner, nose,
# eye, dark, lid, pupil, mark (stripes, points, patches), mark2.
